      <One_Line_Description_Summary/>
      <Description>Provide CANsub class for CAN read and write functions using CCS CANsub devices.</Description>
      <Copyright/>
      <Packager>DOME Automation</Packager>
      <URL/>
      <Release_Notes>0.1.0: first package for bench tests. Class CAN RW CANsub with the CANsub API, C wrapper, codec and common libraries. Not tested with the plugins yet.
0.1.0.2: Update CAN Status makes one REST call in each second at most (to prevent overwhelming the device).</Release_Notes>
    </Description>
